{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34298","headline":"奉和袭美赠魏处士五贶诗 华顶杖 · 陆龟蒙","name":"奉和袭美赠魏处士五贶诗 华顶杖","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"万古阴崖雪，灵根不爲枯。\n瘦於霜鹤胫，奇似黑龙须。\n拄访谭玄客，持看泼墨图。\n湖云如有路，兼可到仙都。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34298.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34298","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}